OL,6,     FA35/BMW Z3: The team take on one
OL,7,     Fof Derek's favourites - an Austin
OL,8,     FA35 - but its age ensures some
OL,9,     Fhefty bills. To bank some cash,
OL,10,     Ftheir second project is a quick
OL,11,     Fflip - a 1999 BMW Z3.
OL,12,G2300 Bangers & Cash
OL,13,     FLand Rover S1/Bentley Mulsanne:
OL,14,     FPaul and daughter Kate collect a
OL,15,     FSeries 1 Land Rover, while Jack
OL,16,     Fcollects an unusual wartime
OL,17,     Fparatrooper's bike in Scarborough.
